- startup loads with:

	thread 1 calls imagewindow_imageui_add()

	imagewindow_imageui_add() calls tilesource_background_load()

	tilesource_background_load() passes tilesource to
	tilesource_background_load_worker()

- replace loads with:

	thread 1 (main thread) calls imagewindow_imageui_add()

	imagewindow_imageui_add() calls tilesource_background_load()

	tilesource_background_load() passes tilesource to
	tilesource_background_load_worker()



- thread 6 worker (thread 17 for replace)

	tilesource_background_load_worker() calls vips_avg()

	vips_avg() calls vips_sink()

	vips_sink() calls vips_threadpool_run()

	vips_threadpool_run() creates workers with vips_thread_execute()

	then loops in vips_threadpool_run() listening for ticks
G
	tick comes back, call vips_image_eval()

	progress_update_percent() queues idle task to update progress bar

	idle task is never called during replace, but is called during 
	initial load




- changing idle priority with g_idle_add_full() does not help

- button mouse-over highlight works during replace load

- window resize works during replace load

- try building debug glib and seeing what idle context 
  progress_update_percent action is adding the event to

	yup, added to same context

